# Changes on top of pcrecomp 2adc02f. One line each: file - what - why.
tools/lift/lift32.py, tools/lift/lift32_sse.py - emit RECOMP_TRAP(va, "mnem") instead of the UNIMPLEMENTED comment - lifter gaps must stop the run and name the address (difftest 374/375 before and after; sse.sqrtps fails before and after)
runtime/recomp32/recomp_types.h - declare recomp_trap/recomp_unresolved_icall, RECOMP_TRAP macro; unresolved ICALL/ITAIL call recomp_unresolved_icall instead of printing and returning 0 - no silent eax = 0 (spec anti-goal: fail loudly)
tools/lift/lift32.py, tools/lift/difftest.py - lift 16-bit pushf/popf; difftest cases pushfd.id-roundtrip, pushf16.after-cmp, popf16.restores-cf; difftest harness defines the bw2 trap hooks - the BW2 protection VM uses 66 9C (difftest 377/378, sqrtps pre-existing)
tools/lift/lift32_sse.py, tools/lift/difftest.py - lift xmm forms of pmaddwd, paddsw, pmulhw, punpckl/hdq, punpckl/hwd; difftest cases incl. saturation/sign words - BW2 has 1,523 such sites (difftest 404/405, sqrtps pre-existing)
runtime/win32hle/host_lite.c - recomp_lookup is RECOMP_WEAK - a host can replace the binary search with an O(1) table (spec 7.1)
runtime/win32hle/hle_path.c, win32hle.h - hle_set_mount: one guest folder is a host folder, both ways (hle_host_path, hle_guest_path) - BW2 must see itself at C:\Program Files\EA GAMES\Black & White 2 while its files live elsewhere; the overlay matches real paths, so a symlink would write into the game tree
tools/lift/lift32.py - a branch to a label at or below itself (jmp, jcc, jecxz, loop*) runs RECOMP_BACKEDGE() first - a lifted spin-wait on another guest thread never handed the machine over (difftest 404/405 before and after, sqrtps pre-existing)
